13. The probability that each agent gets exactly (1 ± α)m/k beads of color i with an approximate solution is at least 1 - e^(±2α/m).
14. The time complexity of the dynamic algorithm for exact necklace splitting is O(log m log^6 m) per batch of updates, and O(1) per bead when only maintaining the tree.
